Yet the proportion of approaches from determined observers rises from approximately 4.8% to 28.6% in that same illustrative model.

The defense reduces total approaches while changing the composition of the remaining threat. That distinction is central to the operator.

The specification also handles silence as a signal, mimicry, habituation, information leakage, receiver adaptation, and how repeated encounters change the environment.

This is an AI-readable specification, not yet a tested executable implementation. A capable agent can use it to construct simulations and evaluate competing interpretations, then test them against evidence.

The Pantheon principle preserved here:

Don’t merely ask what a signal means. Ask who receives it, what they infer, what they do, and how their actions change the board for everyone else.